WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.360
Wh-What's the matter, Master Rio?

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.280
Huh?

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:20.330
W-Wait! It's not like that! 
It's a misunderstanding! This is—

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.620
How can this be?

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:25.920
Onii-chan?! Who is that?

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.590
Wh-What is going on here?

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.880
I-I'm telling you, 
this is a misunderstanding!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.840
A misunderstanding?!

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.760
Th-This is just—

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.890
That's right! It's a misunderstanding!

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:40.220
Everyone, calm down!

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:42.480
Miss Sara, thank you so much.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:46.440
M-Master Rio is simply sleeping 
with a naked woman, that's all!

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:49.840
And we've simply seen something 
we weren't meant to see!

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:52.790
We're the ones actually at fault here!

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.790
Miss Sara, please calm down!

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:54.490
I-I'm so very sorry!

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:56.660
Who is she? Who? Who?

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:58.740
Th-That's right!

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.290
Who are you?

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:03.040
I don't understand what's 
going on here at all!

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.980
Do you think you could explain things to me?

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:10.440
A spirit.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.960
What?

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:20.330
I am the spirit who formed 
a covenant with you, Haruto.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:40.160
Seirei Gensouki

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:40.160
Seirei Gensouki

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:55.900
<b>A Spirit's Awakening</b>

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:55.900
<b>A Spirit's Awakening</b>

00:02:55.900 --> 00:03:00.860
I see. So you're the bonded 
spirit Lady Dryas spoke of.

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:06.200
It's very weak, but I sense the 
presence of a spirit from within you.

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:10.710
So... how did you and I form a covenant?

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:12.700
I don't know.

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:18.410
When I was still small, it was you who 
showed me how to use spirit arts, wasn't it?

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.260
We don't have time right now.

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:26.390
I will teach you about od,
 and how to use your magic power.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.560
Learn it by remembering this feeling.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:30.530
I don't know.

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:33.400
Then why have you suddenly appeared here?

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:36.940
Up until now, you've been 
asleep inside me, right?

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:40.070
I don't know.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:45.350
Is this what happens when a 
bonded spirit first appears?

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:47.990
W-Well...

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:54.260
You see, the spirits we're bonded with 
aren't person-shaped, so we don't really know.

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:55.500
I see.

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:56.850
What's your name?

00:03:57.960 --> 00:03:59.760
I don't know my name, either.

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:03.410
I want a name.

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:08.760
I am by your side, Haruto. 
That's why I want a name.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:11.480
You mean I should give you a name?

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:12.390
Is that wrong?

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:15.740
It's not wrong, but why me?

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:18.680
Because I exist for you, Haruto.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:20.520
Is that so?

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:22.400
U-Um, Master Rio?

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:26.850
This whole time, she's been
 calling you Haruto...

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:31.870
I'll explain later.

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:38.060
About my name...

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:39.830
I know it. Rio.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.880
I know everything about you, Haruto.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:47.890
You can do things like this, too?

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.240
I can speak this way if 
it's with you, Haruto.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:54.960
I see. When you say you know everything, 
do you mean everything about Amakawa Haruto?

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:59.000
Do you mean the Haruto that you 
were before you became this Haruto?

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.110
It seems you do know everything.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.670
Don't worry. I won't tell the others.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:07.360
Would it be better if I called you Rio?

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:09.510
No, you can call me by either name.

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.800
Onii-chan! What's wrong?

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.330
N-Nothing!

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:18.280
About your name... Are you sure you're 
all right with me giving you one?

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:21.090
I want a name you give me, Haruto.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:25.200
All right. Will you give me a little time?

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.090
Yes.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:31.510
Still, this all happened so 
quickly that I'm not sure what to do.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:38.130
What if you asked the Eldest 
and Lady Dryas for advice?

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:39.600
Ask Lady Dryas?

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:40.880
That's a good idea!

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:46.610
Lady Dryas is a person-shaped spirit, too, 
so she may have some counsel for you.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.000
That's true.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.150
Will you come with me?

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:50.970
Yes.

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.330
O-Oh, but before that, your clothes—

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:05.550
Will this clothing do?

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.080
Those clothes...

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:08.650
I wove them from od and mana.

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:11.730
Oh, so that light was from 
a spirit art technique.

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.100
They're so pretty!

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:25.890
Aishia.

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.940
Your name... What do you think of "Aishia"?

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:32.200
Aishia?

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.310
In the ancient language of our village,

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:38.540
it can mean "warm springtime" 
or "beautiful springtime."

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:39.810
Spring?

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:44.670
No, it's... When I looked at you, 
the image of spring just seemed to fit.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:46.920
Yes! I like it!

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:48.630
I like Aishia!

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.170
A warm spring. Spring, 
like the "haru" in Haruto!

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:55.060
If you like it, then...

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:58.930
Nice to meet you, Aishia! Oh, should 
I treat you like an older sister?

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:01.440
That would be disrespectful of you.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.180
Welcome, Lady Aishia.

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:04.430
Welcome!

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:14.660
This person is Sir Rio's bonded spirit?

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.240
So she's finally awakened.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.750
Yes, this morning.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.760
We've heard from Sara and the others.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:23.090
Seems there was quite a commotion.

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:25.100
It was all so sudden...

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:30.010
But I wonder why she has lost her memories.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.510
Her covenant with me is—

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:37.350
Lady Dryas?

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:42.830
I felt a powerful spirit appear 
within the village's barrier.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:45.880
You must be Rio's bonded spirit.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:48.860
I'm Dryas.

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:52.860
I'm Aishia. It's nice to meet you, Dryas.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.870
It seems she's a spirit 
that I don't know, either.

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:00.800
Generally, it is appropriate 
for person-shaped spirits

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:03.370
to keep their memories from 
before their elevation.

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:09.190
Aishia, you don't remember what 
kind of spirit you were, do you?

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:11.560
I am Haruto's bonded spirit.

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:12.780
Haruto?

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:16.190
Yes. There's a bit of a 
situation regarding that.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:20.270
The truth is that in the Strahl region, 
I am wanted by the authorities.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:24.160
When I'm in Strahl, I call myself Haruto.

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:29.110
As it is you, Sir Rio, I am sure the 
circumstances must have been extreme.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:32.390
Let us set aside that 
discussion for the moment.

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:34.110
Thank you very much.

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:39.200
For now, it would be good if we could 
identify what kind of spirit she is, but...

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:42.640
Aishia, what element are you best at?

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:43.600
All of them.

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:46.660
By all of them, you mean...

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:48.000
That's surprising.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:53.280
So... you mean that you're proficient 
with spirit arts of every element?

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:54.510
I think so.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:07.150
I'll really be fighting Aishia?

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:10.610
I've never heard of an all-around-type 
person-shaped spirit.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:14.070
I think an understanding of 
how much power Aishia has

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.580
is something you need to know, too, Rio.

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:18.190
I understand.

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:22.820
When this stone hits the ground, 
our battle will commence.

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:24.400
Are you ready?

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:25.520
Yes.

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:31.590
She's fast!

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:36.760
Amazing!

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:41.670
<i>Her movement... Has she traced 
and copied my techniques?</i>

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.630
<i>I think that's enough close combat.</i>

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.820
This is a really intense battle.

00:09:58.680 --> 00:09:59.990
She disappeared?

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:01.860
She changed to spirit form.

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:20.120
That's the same amount of power as the 
spirit arts that defeated the black wyvern!

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:37.900
End of match!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.620
I'm so very sorry! I got carried away!

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:48.040
If we continue this any longer, I think 
something dire might happen to the village.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:54.080
When Lady Aishia said she was capable in 
every element, it seems she spoke the truth.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.240
Yes.

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:59.510
And I think the strength we saw her use is 
probably only a fraction of what she has.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.730
Truly amazing.

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:05.630
But as she is now, 
she's still unsafe as a spirit.

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:12.440
Aishia, starting now, I will impart 
knowledge about spirits to you.

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:15.290
Thank you very much!

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:16.270
Thank you!

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:23.240
Lady Aishia, we, the People of the Spirits,
 welcome you with all our hearts.

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:28.000
Thank you.

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:40.130
The only ones who can take 
person-shaped forms as we can

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.630
are spirits of at least 
the second-highest level.

00:11:57.670 --> 00:12:00.180
You've made quite an impressive house.

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:02.740
Yes. I made a bath, too.

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:04.340
A bath, too?

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.200
It's a stone-lined bath.

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:10.180
As long as you use spirit arts 
to set a foundation for it,

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:12.130
you can set it up wherever you want.

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:15.090
Master Dominic, I am truly grateful to you.

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:17.210
Cut that out. You act like we're strangers.

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:21.090
I was hoping to pay my respects 
to the Eldest tonight.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:23.130
Huh? Respects?

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.940
You've completed a house I can carry with me.

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:28.610
I was thinking it's about 
time for me to depart.

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:32.660
Wh-When will you be leaving?

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:33.810
The day after tomorrow.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:34.620
What?

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:35.440
I see.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:38.320
Well, then, I'll talk to Syldora and Ursula.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.970
Let's meet at the council hall.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:41.050
Thank you.

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:42.820
W-Well, then!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.440
Time to get ready for the evening meal!

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:47.410
Will you all help me?

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:51.350
Yes! I'll make Onii-chan's 
favorite foods for him!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:52.830
Thank you!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.830
It's quite a sudden departure, isn't it?

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:56.860
What?

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:58.980
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:01.120
I'd decided to go whenever 
the house was ready.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:05.090
We're fine. It's Latifa...

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:10.170
Please spend a little 
time talking with Latifa.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.230
<i>I've been thoughtless.</i>

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:28.440
<i>Since Aishia awakened, I've been too 
focused on my spirit arts training.</i>

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:30.950
<i>I haven't been talking with Latifa as much.</i>

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:33.060
Onii-chan...

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:42.210
I was thinking I'd like to wash 
your back for you, Onii-chan.

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:44.830
Can I?

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:47.020
No, you can't! That's just...

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:50.440
Don't worry. I'm wearing a 
bath towel and everything.

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:51.750
That's not the problem!

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:55.390
Onii-chan, you're leaving the 
village the day after tomorrow.

00:13:55.840 --> 00:13:57.740
It's just today. That's fine, isn't it?

00:13:58.130 --> 00:13:59.970
No! Go put on your clothes!

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:02.980
Then I'm going to get in the bath 
just like this! Is that better?

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:06.010
All right! You can wash my back!

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:06.980
Really?

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:08.990
J-Just today, understand?

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:16.760
Your back really is broad, Onii-chan.

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:17.820
Is it?

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:18.520
Yeah!

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:21.690
I wonder if it'll be even 
broader the next time we meet.

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:23.050
I wonder, too.

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:29.220
Onii-chan, I told you before that 
I used to be Japanese, right?

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:30.440
Yes.

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:34.870
My name back then was Endo Suzune.

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:36.810
What's this all of a sudden?

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:42.030
Big Sis Aishia calls you Haruto, right?

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:46.600
You said it was your alias 
in the Strahl region,

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.230
but I just thought, maybe...

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:49.650
Amakawa Haruto.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:55.600
That's my name from before 
I reincarnated, when I lived in Japan.

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:57.250
I thought that must be it!

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:57.850
What?

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:00.640
I used to take the bus to school, you see.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:06.340
There was someone I wished was my big brother 
who took the same bus as me every day.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.570
But the bus got into an accident.

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:17.580
Then... Latifa, could it be that 
you were in that bus accident, too?

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:21.010
I see.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:24.830
It's just like I thought. 
You're a wonderful big brother!

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:32.050
I'm a terrible big brother 
for not being with you more.

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:33.450
I'm sorry.

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.720
You're going to make sure to come home 
to the village this time too, right?

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:41.450
If you're waiting for me, I'll come back.

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:44.000
No! You have to come back, no matter what!

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.730
I guess I have to make sure
 to come home, then.

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:47.490
Yeah!

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:50.400
Oh, is there anywhere 
that needs more rinsing?

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:52.380
This isn't a hair salon.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:56.910
There's something I have 
to do in the Strahl region.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:16:00.090
It's all okay. You don't 
have to tell me a thing!

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:06.230
Sir Rio, please take this.

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:09.730
It seems to have some kind of 
magical formula sealed inside it.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:11.500
It's a teleportation crystal.

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:14.610
It's a magic item that allows the user 
to teleport to designated coordinates.

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:17.790
That one has been set to this village.

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:21.250
Using it will allow you to 
come back here quite easily.

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.600
But it only works in one direction,

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:26.690
so it can't take you back 
to where you came from.

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:29.740
A spirit stone of this caliber 
must be very precious.

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.220
You are our sworn friend.

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:35.670
To let a sworn friend set out 
on a journey empty-handed

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:38.390
would sully the name of
 the People of the Spirits!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.100
Oh, right.

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:42.280
You didn't forget the stone 
house we built, did you?

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:44.470
No, I have it in the space-time cache.

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:46.100
Take this with you, too.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.380
It will allow you to change the 
color of your hair at will.

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:50.610
My hair?

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:55.120
If you are a wanted man in Strahl, 
then I am sure it will prove useful.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:56.610
Thank you very much.

00:16:56.610 --> 00:17:00.350
Aishia, don't forget what I've taught you.

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:01.370
I won't.

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:03.890
Please look after my little sister.

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:05.370
We will! Leave her to us!

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:08.450
Honestly! I'm not a child!

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:11.380
Have a safe trip.

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:14.510
Thanks. I will.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:25.750
There's something I have to do in Strahl,

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:28.250
but before that, there's someone I want to see.

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:29.270
Celia?

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:32.590
That's right. You know everything.

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:37.110
After that first letter, I haven't been 
able to communicate with her, but...

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:52.090
So this is where you've been.

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:53.860
Lord Charles...

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:58.840
How formal. Won't you 
call me "darling," Celia?

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:02.330
I-I couldn't. I'm too shy 
to do anything like that.

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:06.170
That feminine modesty of 
yours is truly splendid.

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:09.370
I look forward to seeing 
how you will change in time.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:10.490
Lord Charles!

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.460
If you would come with me, my lord.

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:13.610
Dear, dear...

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:16.470
In these times, with our 
kingdom in such chaos,

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:18.280
while the great Houses do 
bear great responsibility,

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:20.630
being so busy is quite the inconvenience.

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:25.370
If you aren't there, Lord Charles, 
everyone around will grow anxious.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:29.740
Please don't spare a thought for me and go.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:32.340
Then, we'll meet again soon.

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:33.080
Yes, my lord.

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:40.500
Rio...

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:49.770
<b>Beltrant, Royal Capital of the Beltrum Kingdom
 Year 1000 of the Holy Era, Spring</b>

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.470
Is something wrong?

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:59.360
No. I was just thinking, 
it seems really crowded.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.870
It was bustling before, too, of course.

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.280
Shall we try asking over there?

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.500
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:12.310
Thank you.

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:13.490
Thanks for your patronage.

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:15.690
There are a lot of people passing by here.

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:20.170
Oh, it's because tomorrow there's 
going to be a noble's wedding parade.

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:23.480
Apparently, lots of people have come 
from outside the royal capital.

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:25.650
Nobles? From which House?

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:27.570
Duke Arbor's House.

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:30.270
I see. One of the great noble Houses.

00:19:31.890 --> 00:19:33.570
I'm going to the Academy next.

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:36.520
Aishia, you can rest if you'd rather.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.240
I'm fine. I'll go, too.

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:43.400
As I can take spirit form, 
I'm sure I'll be useful.

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:45.940
Then, I suppose I'll be counting 
on you, with my thanks.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:46.740
Yes.

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:06.180
Before, this was easy to unlock, but...

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:11.600
I suppose I should have just 
asked you in the first place.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:26.390
Stay safe... until you return, all right?

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:38.900
She's not here?

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:44.680
This is...

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:47.040
Did she change research rooms?

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:49.430
She wouldn't have quit 
the Academy, would she?

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:51.880
What will you do?

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:55.070
It's a bit of a risk,

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:58.250
but if there are researchers 
in any of the other rooms,

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:00.540
we can use illusions and ask them.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.690
All right. Leave it to me.

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:09.580
Is someone there?

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:17.990
I have some business with 
Celia Claire. Where is she?

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:20.860
Oh, she's in the royal palace.

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:22.210
The royal palace?

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:28.280
Ahead of the wedding ceremony.

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:31.900
I'm sure they're wary of Duke Huguenot's
 faction making a move.

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:34.740
Wedding? Whose?

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:37.710
Celia's, of course.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:43.910
Professor Celia is getting married?

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:46.610
Who is she marrying?

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:49.570
Lord Charles of the House of Duke Arbor.

00:21:57.070 --> 00:21:58.300
Charles...

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:02.720
She's marrying Charles Arbor?

